Output 01_basic_styling.gif
Screenshot 01_basic_styling_start.ansi

Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1000
Set Height 600
Set Theme "Dracula"

Type "cd /home/ubuntu/lipgloss-course/examples"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "echo 'Running Basic Styling Examples...'"
Enter
Sleep 1s

Type "go run 01-basic-styling.go"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Screenshot 01_basic_styling_output.ansi
Sleep 2s

